KG42.register("clusters-3039caebd639a103e576b870",{"id":"30-motivational_game::v142-d-K002","paper":"30-motivational_game","label":"Payment and injection initiation after all order matching","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K002","label":"Payment and injection initiation after all order matching","market_meaning":"Buy and sell orders enter matching; after all peer orders are matched, payment and physical-layer energy exchange are carried out. Payment is used to initiate the seller's renewable energy injection, and the source text explicitly states that it does not directly control physical delivery.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["matching","settlement","activation"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"The connection is limited to the general P2P virtual-layer and physical-layer description in 2.1. R002 shares the matching, payment and execution interfaces in this cluster; its CPS surplus/deficit scenario is not thereby converted by the reference into proof of implementation of that general procedure.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"There is a clear source-text responsibility dependency among order input, the matching-completion threshold, and payment initiation of injection, sufficient to assemble a qualitative fulfillment procedure across matching, settlement and execution. The payment threshold and the execution threshold have different responsibilities and still retain their respective constraints; this cluster does not claim that the matching algorithm or payment amount calculation has been provided.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provide the two input interfaces through which buyer and seller orders enter matching."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R008","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Bear the procedural condition that payment is made only after all peer orders have been matched."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Share the execution conditions of C001, the payment and injection interfaces of C002, and related existing nodes; primary attribution remains with the surplus trading cluster, and the remaining case provisions are not repeatedly counted as rules of this cluster."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CN005","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C002","v141-c-R003::V::matching.counterparties"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"Buy and sell orders constitute the matching input; E10 explicitly takes completion of all order matching as the payment threshold. This connects the matching interface with the payment responsibility on the basis of an explicit condition rather than a general process arrow."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CN006","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::matching.counterparties","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"The same general description explicitly makes completion of all order matching the condition for physical-layer energy exchange; the matching result is therefore the interface for the execution condition, and no matching algorithm is added."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CN007","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R008::V::settlement.payment","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::settlement.payment","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E10","v141-b-g01-E11"],"rationale":"E10 provides the matching-completion condition for payment, and E11 states that this payment is used to initiate seller injection; the two chains together complete the precondition and function of the same payment act, but it is not thereby claimed that payment directly controls electricity delivery."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM003","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::matching.counterparties","v141-c-R008::V::matching.counterparties","v141-c-R002::V::matching.counterparties"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R003::V::matching.counterparties","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E10"],"rationale":"All three references point to the same matching function in the general virtual-layer description; the R003 reference is selected only as a display representative. The input, payment condition and execution condition of each chain are still retained separately, and all originals remain accessible."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM004","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R008::V::settlement.payment","v141-c-R002::V::settlement.payment"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R008::V::settlement.payment","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E10","v141-b-g01-E11"],"rationale":"The two chains reference the same general P2P payment function, expressing respectively the payment precondition and the injection-initiation role; the selection of R008 is only for node display and does not merge the constraints or edges of two different responsibilities."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-G006","category":"unverified_source","description":"The citations on which the matching threshold, payment and injection initiation are based all remain unverified; assembled for this cluster only means that these chains can form the described qualitative procedure candidate.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R003","v141-c-R008","v141-c-R002"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C002","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E10","v141-b-g01-E11"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check all matching conditions, payment roles and physical delivery restrictions in the source text, and review node identity mappings; the candidate status is maintained until source-text verification is complete."}]},"rule_refs":["30-motivational_game::v141-c-R003","30-motivational_game::v141-c-R008","30-motivational_game::v141-c-R002"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-189f5500ef3981fa","COMP-2a46795d52ce8b8d","COMP-4cf3718d101da7ca","COMP-80c9b12d3ea35c91","COMP-c0cbb067ee5d581a"]});
